@ The ending: after SNICKERS stops the storm, AHMED and OMAR finally talk (peace talks #2, in
@ SOOTOPOLIS), then bring the STRAWBERRY and the CHEESE back to MT. PYRE together. AHMED changes the
@ password back, OMAR gives SAFETY ZONE five stars on YELP, and HAMZA's help review goes back up.
@ Also: the SAFETY ZONE office in MAUVILLE (its guard is added in game/story.py), and MOM, who has
@ had it with HISHAM.

@@ file: data/maps/SootopolisCity/scripts.inc
SootopolisCity_Text_GroudonPleaseStop:
	.string "AHMED: C… CEASER…\n"
	.string "Please! Stop what you're doing!\p"
	.string "I know the extent of your power now!\p"
	.string "If you keep going, all HOENN, not just\n"
	.string "SOOTOPOLIS, will be utterly ruined!$"

SootopolisCity_Text_AfterAllOurScheming:
	.string "AHMED: …One swipe.\p"
	.string "SNICKERS fixed the whole sky with\n"
	.string "one swipe.\p"
	.string "And OMAR and I can't even fix\n"
	.string "a password.\p"
	.string "… … … … … …\p"
	.string "OMAR. We need to talk.$"

SootopolisCity_Text_TryingMeaninglessToPokemon:
	.string "OMAR: …Yeah. We do.\p"
	.string "HALEEB and CEASER flew off, and the\n"
	.string "weather's back to normal.\p"
	.string "All that, and the legends just\n"
	.string "went home. Like it was nothing.\p"
	.string "Okay. MT. PYRE. We bring the treats\n"
	.string "back, and we talk.\p"
	.string "Somebody call MO.\n"
	.string "Tell him to bring the fries.$"

SootopolisCity_Text_MaxieArchieLeft:
	.string "TAHA: AHMED and OMAR left together.\n"
	.string "To MT. PYRE, I think.\p"
	.string "PROF. MO ran after them with a bag\n"
	.string "of crazy fries.\p"
	.string "That's MUAH, right there.$"

@@ file: data/maps/MtPyre_Summit/scripts.inc
MtPyre_Summit_Text_MaxieSilence:
	.string "AHMED: {PLAYER}…\p"
	.string "We brought back the STRAWBERRY and\n"
	.string "the CHEESE. Together.\p"
	.string "Then we sat down with MO and a mountain\n"
	.string "of crazy fries with fluffy sauce.\p"
	.string "We talked. For hours.\p"
	.string "OMAR: Turns out he changed the\n"
	.string "password because I deleted HAMZA's\l"
	.string "help review.\p"
	.string "AHMED: And he deleted it because I\n"
	.string "never let him do anything.\p"
	.string "So I said sorry. And I changed the\n"
	.string "password back.\p"
	.string "OMAR: I logged in. First try.\p"
	.string "And I gave SAFETY ZONE a review\n"
	.string "on YELP. Five stars.\p"
	.string "“Great security.\n"
	.string "Boss is kind of strict.”\p"
	.string "AHMED: …And HAMZA's help review is\n"
	.string "back up, too. He got his help.\p"
	.string "OMAR: MO cried. A little.\p"
	.string "AHMED: Thank you, {PLAYER}.\n"
	.string "You and MO kept the peace.\p"
	.string "OMAR, back at the office. Monday.\n"
	.string "Real work.\p"
	.string "OMAR: …Thinking work counts.\p"
	.string "AHMED: …Fine. For now.$"

MtPyre_Summit_Text_ThoseTwoMenReturnedOrbs:
	.string "The two men who took the treats came\n"
	.string "back to return them on their own.\p"
	.string "Then they ate fries and argued about\n"
	.string "a password for three hours.\p"
	.string "Those men…\n"
	.string "Perhaps they are friends after all…$"

@@ file: data/maps/MauvilleCity_House1/scripts.inc
MauvilleCity_House1_Text_ImRockSmashDudeTakeThis:
	.string "Welcome to the SAFETY ZONE office!\n"
	.string "I'm the office manager.\p"
	.string "AHMED's out. OMAR's out. Permanently,\n"
	.string "if you ask AHMED.\p"
	.string "Your POKéMON look pretty strong.\n"
	.string "I like that!\p"
	.string "We use this for security drills.\n"
	.string "Here, take this HIDDEN MACHINE!$"

MauvilleCity_House1_Text_ExplainRockSmash:
	.string "That HM contains ROCK SMASH.\p"
	.string "If a boulder blocks your path,\n"
	.string "smash it right out of your way!\p"
	.string "That's how AHMED handles doors\n"
	.string "when OMAR changes the locks.$"

MauvilleCity_House1_Text_MonCanFlyOutOfSmashedRock:
	.string "If you smash a rock, a POKéMON\n"
	.string "could come flying out of hiding.\p"
	.string "Kind of like OMAR, on payday.$"

@@ file: data/maps/LittlerootTown/scripts.inc
LittlerootTown_Text_OurNewHomeLetsGoInside:
	.string "MOM: {PLAYER}, we're here, honey!\p"
	.string "It must be tiring riding with our things\n"
	.string "in the moving truck.\p"
	.string "Well, this is LITTLEROOT TOWN.\n"
	.string "Our new home!\p"
	.string "Your father lives over in PETALBURG.\n"
	.string "Not that he'll ever visit.\p"
	.string "And, you get your own room, {PLAYER}!\n"
	.string "Let's go inside.$"

LittlerootTown_Text_WearTheseRunningShoes:
	.string "MOM: {PLAYER}! {PLAYER}! Did you\n"
	.string "introduce yourself to PROF. MO?\p"
	.string "Oh! What an adorable POKéMON!\n"
	.string "You look good together!\p"
	.string "Now listen, honey. Your father,\n"
	.string "HISHAM, left me on the side of\l"
	.string "the road. Literally. On a highway.\p"
	.string "He'd rather hang out with the\n"
	.string "MOVERSE than with his own family.\p"
	.string "PROF. MO, MO ABDU, MOSTAFA…\n"
	.string "Every MO in HOENN.\p"
	.string "So here's the plan. Defeat the\n"
	.string "MOVERSE. Beat every GYM.\p"
	.string "Then go confront your father.\p"
	.string "Here, wear these RUNNING SHOES.\n"
	.string "They'll put a zip in your step!$"

@@ file: data/maps/LittlerootTown_BrendansHouse_1F/scripts.inc
PlayersHouse_1F_Text_MoversPokemonGoSetClock:
	.string "The mover's POKéMON do all the work\n"
	.string "of moving us in and cleaning up after.\l"
	.string "This is so convenient!\p"
	.string "{PLAYER}, your room is upstairs.\n"
	.string "Go check it out, dear!\p"
	.string "I bought you a new clock. Your father\n"
	.string "didn't buy anything. As usual.\l"
	.string "Don't forget to set it!$"

PlayersHouse_1F_Text_MaybeDadWillBeOn:
	.string "MOM: Look! It's PETALBURG GYM!\n"
	.string "Your father's on TV again.$"

PlayersHouse_1F_Text_ItsOverWeMissedHim:
	.string "MOM: Oh… It's over.\p"
	.string "Good. He was playing pool with the\n"
	.string "MOVERSE. On live TV.$"

PlayersHouse_1F_Text_GoIntroduceYourselfNextDoor:
	.string "Oh, yes.\n"
	.string "PROF. MO lives right next door.\p"
	.string "He's one of your father's MOVERSE.\n"
	.string "But he's nice. Go say hi.$"

PlayersHouse_1F_Text_YouShouldRestABit:
	.string "MOM: How are you doing, {PLAYER}?\n"
	.string "You look a little tired.\p"
	.string "Rest a bit. The MOVERSE won't\n"
	.string "defeat itself.$"

PlayersHouse_1F_Text_GotDadsBadgeHeresSomethingFromMom:
	.string "MOM: Oh? You beat your father?\n"
	.string "Good.\p"
	.string "Then here's something from your MOM!$"

PlayersHouse_1F_Text_BetterGetBackToGym:
	.string "I'd better get back to PETALBURG.\n"
	.string "The MOVERSE is at the pool table.\p"
	.string "Thanks for looking after the house.$"

PlayersHouse_1F_Text_DadShouldStayLonger:
	.string "MOM: That father of yours…\p"
	.string "Five minutes, then he runs back\n"
	.string "to the MOVERSE.\p"
	.string "He left me on the side of the road,\n"
	.string "you know. I haven't forgotten.$"
